## What's New in v5.0.0

### AIModels String Catalog
- Provider-organized `AIModels` constants for direct string-based model selection
- Supports exact provider model IDs and dated variants without enum-style usage in application code

### Request-Scoped Runtime Control
- Added `AIRequestProfile` for one-shot per-call overrides such as `Stateless`, `DisableFunctions`, `DisableReasoning`, `Temperature`, and `MaxTokens`
- Added built-in presets via `RequestProfiles.QueryRewrite` and `RequestProfiles.Summarization`

### Request-Scoped Prompt Composition
- Added `AIRequestContext` with `SystemMessagePrefix`, `SystemMessageSuffix`, `RequestMessageOverride`, and `AdditionalMessages`

### Static Stateless Helpers
- Added `AIService.QuickAskAsync(...)`
- Added `AIService.QuickAskWithImageAsync(...)`

## Supported Models

